	unit_check 13 13 63 Greater|Jump 0 0 fulcrum|mantle|iron_foundry barracks|captaincy|apothecary|starpad|starport|nanite_assembly defense_handling_armor 13
	unit_check 13 13 63 Greater|Jump 0 0 starpad|starport|nanite_assembly barracks|captaincy|apothecary|fulcrum|mantle|iron_foundry defense_handling_orbital 13
	return
	
