	bring 13 AtM 9 maverick|harakan|cyprian|eidolon|savant|madcap|heracles|apostle|siren|striga|olympian|autocrat|dilettante|sevenstep|silvertongue|sevenstep|silvertongue|emperor|jester|vulture|cyclops|goliath|blackjack|matador|phalanx|madrigal|ramesses|durendal|cataphract|paladin|cuirass|pazuzu|claymore|penumbra|anticthon|aion|wraith|gorgon|wyvern|salamander|sundog|centaur|minotaur|magnetar|pegasus|hippogriff|oberon|phobos Loc.63 attack_generic_add
